  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Transforming Island Development through Electrification and Sustainability (TIDES)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The&#xA0;Transforming Island Development through Electrification and Sustainability (&lt;strong&gt;TIDES&lt;/strong&gt;)&#xA0;is a private sector led renewable energy investment and market development fund for the Pacific. It targets underdeveloped segments of the market, including commercial and industrial consumers, micro-grids for rural/outer island communities, and small Independent Power Producers.</narrative>
  </description>
